{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Five women. Three surfers. One island. A summer they\u2019ll never forget.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/extras/About_Page_01.png?t=1745968545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Margaret thought her birthday celebration with her girlfriend Arabelle would be simple\u2014sun, laughter, and maybe a few stolen kisses by the beach. But things take a thrilling turn when Arabelle reveals her real birthday surprise: Morgan, a world-class surfer with magnetic charm and a body sculpted by waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the moment their eyes meet, Margaret feels a flutter in her chest\u2014a rush she hasn\u2019t felt since falling for Arabelle. It\u2019s confusing, it\u2019s thrilling... it feels like falling in love for the very first time all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/extras/About_Page_02.png?t=1745968545\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 beautifully hand-drawn characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning tropical scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light and casual story full of flirty moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching dialogue options and two unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your outfits \u2014 from sweet to sizzling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in fun beachside events and conquer everyone's hearts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chill and romantic soundtrack to set the summer vibe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/extras/GIF_01_V02.gif?t=1745968545\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pick your heat level.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're here for the charm or the spice, Summer Passion lets you control how steamy things get. Step back, relax, and tailor your experience the way you like it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mature content warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/extras/GIF_03.gif?t=1745968545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/extras/GIF_02_V02.gif?t=1745968545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains explicit adult content and is intended for mature audiences only. All characters are fictional and over the age of 21.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready to ride the summer tide?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let Margaret's summer sweep you off your feet\u2014where radiant days, flirty nights, and sweet moments await in Summer Passion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681750?t=1745968545","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/3cb556689f4544bc12a9c773c1dba11d836c203d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745968545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/96ea864b1225c127d0871ba6a2bda1c0df2e48cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745968545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/96ea864b1225c127d0871ba6a2bda1c0df2e48cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745968545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Summer Passion features graphic depictions of sexual acts. This game is intended ONLY for a mature audience. All cha